{"uuid": "440542b8-481e-4044-81eb-dcf49eac7362", "message": "1100000111000111010110001011000110011011001000000100110011001100", "container": "Social media has become an integral part of our lives, impacting various aspects, including relationships. Its influence on relationships can be both positive and negative. On the positive side, social media platforms allow individuals to connect and communicate with each other easily, regardless of distance. It can also provide a platform for expressing love and support publicly. On the other hand, excessive use of social media can lead to a decrease in face-to-face interactions, causing a strain on relationships. Moreover, the constant exposure to other people's seemingly perfect relationships can create unrealistic expectations. Therefore, it's important to strike a balance and use social media in a healthy manner.", "encoded_message": "Societal platforms features evolved into an essential component of our day-to-day lives, affecting multiple facets, comprising interactions. Its impact on interactions can be both constructive and detrimental. Upon the favorable aspect, societal networks services enable people to link and interact with each other smoothly, irrespective of space. It can also offer a medium for conveying affection and assistance openly. Upon the opposite side, extreme utilization of communal channels can contribute to a reduction in direct interactions, causing a strain on relationships. Moreover, the constant exposure to other people's seemingly perfect relationships can create unrealistic expectations. Therefore, it's important to strike a balance and use social media in a healthy manner.", "secret_key": [{"Social": {"0": "Communal", "1": "Societal"}}, {"media": {"00": "outlets", "01": "channels", "10": "platforms", "11": "networks"}}, {"has": {"0": "features", "1": "possesses"}}, {"become": {"0": "evolved into", "1": "transformed into"}}, {"an": {"0": "an", "1": "an"}}, {"integral": {"00": "essential", "01"